# A landscape fullscreen app run turned on the PDA profile (report 038 S2, report 041): while it is in front it owns the
# whole panel in landscape (its own display backend at rotate 0, 800x480 or 640x480: no writing zone, no key strip) and
# its keyboard rule is the usual one (input.state vkb=auto: a physical keyboard first, else its own keyboard); when the
# launcher takes the panel back the band is drawn again and the zone is the text input again (vkb=zone). The app's frame
# is a test picture drawn into the framebuffer as the app would (the portrait shot shows it sideways). Goldens at both
# sizes.
title zone turned
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=store_100.png"
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
expect_vkb zone
shot zone_turned_home
turnedapp on
expect_vkb auto
expect_fb paused
shot zone_turned
turnedapp off
expect_vkb zone
expect_same zone_turned_home
